    "summary": "Qualified owned Node22.22.1/npm10.9.4 on macOS arm64 and OrbStack Ubuntu24.04 Linux arm64/x64 with real installs/full builds/native loads and real Linux daemon start/status/restart/stop, exact kernel executable identities and confirmed cleanup. Corrected Python cache mutation and portable archive metadata. Owned shell and shared build environments now default ONNXRUNTIME_NODE_INSTALL_CUDA=skip only when absent, preserving explicit values including empty; regenerated client assets and passed actual shell/TUI npm inheritance tests. On OrbStack x64, with caller CUDA variables absent, both real ONNX 1.21.0/1.19.2 postinstall scripts succeeded with the automatic default; CPU binding loaded and trusted cache verification passed. Evidence: docs/plans/node-runtime-evidence/qualification-linux-orbstack.md and qualification-darwin-arm64.md. Both test machines stopped; no remaining owned actors/leases. Linux x64 is emulated, full builds used 8 GB per VM; no physical x86, GPU/inference, full sweep, IDE UI or signed Linux bundle qualification claimed. Intel macOS disabled, Windows unsupported. Human BUILD approval pending; automated reviews unavailable.",
